<title>MALAYSIA: S&amp;P Food says to acquire another firm.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P Food says to acquire another firm.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>S&amp;P Food Industries (M) Bhd said it was finalising the terms of a proposed acquisition of another firm.</p>
<p>The maker and exporter of food products, in a statement to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange, asked for an extension to the suspension of its stock as it was unable to make an immediate announcement on the planned acquisition.</p>
<p>S&amp;P stock was last traded on June 26 at 20.70 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
